    "regime_notes": "Positive daily IC in 2020-2022 (+0.02537), 2023-2024 (+0.01429), and 2025-2027 (+0.00840); predictive strength decays in the latest regime but does not reverse. Cross-section uses 15 tradable benchmark assets and requires at least 8 valid instruments per date. Daily IC and ICIR clear benchmark gates of absolute IC 0.0070 and absolute ICIR 0.0840; uncertainty is interpreted conservatively due to small cross-section."
